WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:04.711
Roxy watched the alien zoom away on the scooter.

2
00:00:04.712 --> 00:00:08.112
"He's controlling the robots!" she shouted.

3
00:00:08.113 --> 00:00:11.207
Cozlin looked angry. "Let's get him!"

4
00:00:11.208 --> 00:00:15.272
The alien glanced over his shoulder.

5
00:00:15.273 --> 00:00:20.369
"Oh no!" His scooter shot forward with incredible speed.

6
00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:26.653
Roxy and Cozlin chased the alien as he zipped back and forth between large boulders.

7
00:00:26.654 --> 00:00:32.692
He soon arrived at a clearing where other aliens stood near a spaceship.

8
00:00:32.693 --> 00:00:36.279
"They're not Delkorians," Cozlin said.

9
00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:41.268
Roxy and Cozlin approached them.

10
00:00:41.269 --> 00:00:45.476
"Who are you?" Cozlin asked, looking stern.

11
00:00:45.477 --> 00:00:48.465
An alien stepped forward.

12
00:00:48.466 --> 00:00:54.516
"Please don't hurt us! My name is Eldin, and we're from the planet Trell."

13
00:00:54.517 --> 00:00:58.636
"What are you doing on Delkor?" Cozlin asked.

14
00:00:58.637 --> 00:01:04.578
"We've been flying through space," Eldin said, "looking for a new home."

15
00:01:04.579 --> 00:01:12.678
Cozlin narrowed her eyes. "And you thought you could use those robots to take over Delkor!

16
00:01:12.679 --> 00:01:15.836
Then you could make it your new home!"

17
00:01:15.837 --> 00:01:22.706
Eldin's eyes went wide. "Absolutely not! We were trying to get away from the robots on Trell.

18
00:01:22.707 --> 00:01:25.374
We didn't realize one was on our spaceship.

19
00:01:25.375 --> 00:01:29.523
It must have sneaked on while we were evacuating Trell."

20
00:01:29.524 --> 00:01:35.382
"It wasn't just one robot," Roxy said. "There are lots of them!"

21
00:01:35.383 --> 00:01:37.538
Eldin shook his head.

22
00:01:37.539 --> 00:01:40.729
"There was only one robot on board our spaceship.

23
00:01:40.730 --> 00:01:44.853
It found the ship's controls and crashed the ship here.

24
00:01:44.854 --> 00:01:50.497
Our mechanics are now trying to fix our ship." He sighed.

25
00:01:50.498 --> 00:01:55.092
"We are so sorry for bringing that robot here."

26
00:01:55.093 --> 00:02:00.575
Cozlin chuckled. "Don't feel too bad, Eldin.

27
00:02:00.576 --> 00:02:04.709
The robots are annoying, but I can handle them."

28
00:02:04.710 --> 00:02:10.464
Roxy frowned. "You mean, we can handle them."

29
00:02:10.465 --> 00:02:13.715
"I doubt you can stop them," Eldin said.

30
00:02:13.716 --> 00:02:16.531
"That's why we had to flee Trell.

31
00:02:16.532 --> 00:02:21.133
Those robots took over our entire planet in just a couple of weeks.

32
00:02:21.134 --> 00:02:24.666
And Trell wasn't the first planet they invaded.

33
00:02:24.667 --> 00:02:30.007
They've taken over other planets, and once they invade, they quickly make more robots.

34
00:02:30.008 --> 00:02:33.126
There's no way to stop them."

35
00:02:33.127 --> 00:02:36.190
Roxy gulped and looked at Cozlin.

36
00:02:36.191 --> 00:02:42.787
"I have to help her," Roxy thought. "Her entire planet is in danger."

37
00:02:42.788 --> 00:02:47.620
"Do you know where the robots first came from?" Cozlin asked Eldin.

38
00:02:47.621 --> 00:02:50.248
"No," Eldin said.

39
00:02:50.249 --> 00:02:55.215
Cozlin turned to Roxy. "I have a plan. Let's go."

40
00:02:55.216 --> 00:03:01.708
Roxy and Cozlin said good-bye to the Trellians and headed back toward the city.

41
00:03:01.709 --> 00:03:05.954
"We have to find the original robot," Cozlin said.

42
00:03:05.955 --> 00:03:10.223
"If we destroy it, all the others will stop working."

43
00:03:10.224 --> 00:03:16.678
"We tried that," Roxy said. "We don't know which one is the original."

44
00:03:16.679 --> 00:03:20.895
"The original probably isn't here," Cozlin said.

45
00:03:20.896 --> 00:03:26.455
"You heard Eldin's story. Those robots have invaded other planets.

46
00:03:26.456 --> 00:03:30.481
We have to get a good look at the technology the robots use.

47
00:03:30.482 --> 00:03:34.512
Then we can figure out where they came from."

48
00:03:34.513 --> 00:03:43.455
"Good idea!" Roxy said. "Let's get one of the robots we destroyed."

49
00:03:43.456 --> 00:03:48.236
Roxy and Cozlin flew back to the city.

50
00:03:48.237 --> 00:03:53.367
By now all the vehicles were gone, but robots were still everywhere.

51
00:03:53.368 --> 00:03:59.707
"The robots must have turned all the vehicles into other robots," Cozlin said.

52
00:03:59.708 --> 00:04:03.425
"That's not all they did," Roxy said.

53
00:04:03.426 --> 00:04:08.807
"Look around . . . There are no more broken robots.

54
00:04:08.808 --> 00:04:13.868
They must have turned them into new robots as well!"

